[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: REQ-VAL-002 · Acceptance criteria

[GRAMMAR]
IMPORT_FROM_FILE: @requirements

[ACCEPTANCE_CRITERION]
UID: REQ-VAL-002.AC-1
STATEMENT: A division request with b = "0" is rejected with the error code DIVISION_BY_ZERO.
VERIF_LEVELS: unit, system
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: REQ-VAL-002

[ACCEPTANCE_CRITERION]
UID: REQ-VAL-002.AC-2
STATEMENT: A division request with b equal to "-0", "+0", "000" or "0.000" is rejected with the error code DIVISION_BY_ZERO.
VERIF_LEVELS: unit, system
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: REQ-VAL-002

[ACCEPTANCE_CRITERION]
UID: REQ-VAL-002.AC-3
STATEMENT: A division request with a = "0" and b = "0" is rejected with the error code DIVISION_BY_ZERO.
VERIF_LEVELS: unit, system
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: REQ-VAL-002

[ACCEPTANCE_CRITERION]
UID: REQ-VAL-002.AC-4
STATEMENT: A division request with a = "abc" and b = "0" is rejected with the error code INVALID_NUMBER.
VERIF_LEVELS: unit, system
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: REQ-VAL-002

[ACCEPTANCE_CRITERION]
UID: REQ-VAL-002.AC-5
STATEMENT: Addition, subtraction and multiplication requests with b = "0" are not rejected.
VERIF_LEVELS: unit, system
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: REQ-VAL-002
